### Compute the RPM score using new way: largest representative species

```

```{r new RPM score}
# load('/data/mchomm/Homm-UTI-transcriptome/data/reads.meta.counts.496.RData')
load("/data/mchomm/Homm-UTI-transcriptome/data/bracken_rpm_496.RData")

seven.pathogens <- c("Escherichia coli", "Klebsiella pneumoniae", "Enterococcus faecalis", "Proteus mirabilis", 
                     "Pseudomonas aeruginosa", "Staphylococcus saprophyticus", "Streptococcus agalactiae") 

